Section 2: The Network Map
What does IP stand for?
I know this from previous education and experience - Internet Protocol.

How many octets are in an IPv4 address?
Again, basic OSINT - 4.

Is 10.10.16.5 a public or private IP address?
This one is private.

Is 8.8.8.8 public or private?
It is not within a private range; therefore, it is public.

192.168.1.1 is a common home router address. Public or private?
Private

172.20.50.1. The private range for 172 is 172.16 through 172.31. This is 172.20, which falls in that range. Public or private?
Private - the second octet is a 20, which is between 16 and 31.

52.214.98.1 is an AWS cloud server. 52 isn't in any private range. Public or private?
Public

Is 185.174.137.42 public or private?
Public

How many VLANs (network zones) does Whiskers & Wonders have?
